WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.186 --> 00:00:01.669
(upbeat music)
(humming)

00:00:01.669 --> 00:00:02.502
(laughing)

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:05.788
- My life is being made right now so much.

00:00:05.788 --> 00:00:09.455
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:11.035 --> 00:00:14.595
- Hi everyone, I am Emma
Bunton from the Spice Girls,

00:00:14.595 --> 00:00:17.663
and I am here to freak out some fans.

00:00:17.663 --> 00:00:21.330
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:28.477 --> 00:00:30.311
- I was, and I am, and I will remain

00:00:30.311 --> 00:00:33.496
a gigantic Spice Girls
fan my whole entire life.

00:00:33.496 --> 00:00:35.278
It's mainly the reason I feel like

00:00:35.278 --> 00:00:36.695
a confident woman in my life.

00:00:36.695 --> 00:00:38.396
- I actually live my life

00:00:38.396 --> 00:00:41.093
according to the philosophy of the Spice.

00:00:41.093 --> 00:00:43.430
- I had a Spice Girls
themed birthday party,

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.218
where I only invited enough people

00:00:45.218 --> 00:00:46.901
to fill out the Spice Girls.

00:00:46.901 --> 00:00:48.642
- And they were just the first girls

00:00:48.642 --> 00:00:52.216
I could identify with
as adolescence/tween.

00:00:52.216 --> 00:00:53.049
- I had all the dolls,

00:00:53.049 --> 00:00:55.202
I had all the little fan books.

00:00:55.202 --> 00:00:57.381
I had a Spiceworld movie thing.

00:00:57.381 --> 00:00:58.980
I had the Polaroid camera.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:01:00.140
- I had their posters on my wall

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.138
and learned all their dance routines.

00:01:02.138 --> 00:01:04.398
- The Spice Girls were legit my life.

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:07.005
- If I could say one thing to
the Spice Girls, it would be,

00:01:07.005 --> 00:01:08.537
- Honestly, this is gonna sound so cheesy,

00:01:08.537 --> 00:01:09.549
but it would be thank you.

00:01:09.549 --> 00:01:12.128
- Thank you so much for existing.

00:01:12.128 --> 00:01:15.249
- Thank you for making me a powerful

00:01:15.249 --> 00:01:16.336
and empowered woman.

00:01:16.336 --> 00:01:18.428
- You were a huge part of my childhood.

00:01:18.428 --> 00:01:19.261
(uplifting instrumental music)

00:01:19.261 --> 00:01:20.716
(man mumbling)
(Emma mumbling)

00:01:20.716 --> 00:01:21.549
- No!

00:01:22.984 --> 00:01:23.817
I'm sorry, I don't mean to yell at you.

00:01:23.817 --> 00:01:24.756
- I want to say thank you.

00:01:24.756 --> 00:01:26.814
- Can I get a zigazig ah?

00:01:26.814 --> 00:01:28.267
Or something?

00:01:28.267 --> 00:01:29.600
- What the hell?

00:01:31.126 --> 00:01:32.793
Why are you so cool?

00:01:33.983 --> 00:01:34.816
Oh my God!

00:01:36.597 --> 00:01:38.345
- And I'm still so brightly--

00:01:38.345 --> 00:01:39.345
- Oh my God!

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:41.863
Oh my God!

00:01:44.202 --> 00:01:45.035
- What are you doing here?

00:01:45.035 --> 00:01:45.922
- Oh my God you said my name.

00:01:45.922 --> 00:01:47.810
(both laughing)

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:51.060
- And for (screaming).

00:01:52.018 --> 00:01:52.851
- What do you mean?

00:01:52.851 --> 00:01:54.480
- Oh my God!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.313
Oh my God!

00:01:56.398 --> 00:01:57.231
Oh my God!

00:01:58.832 --> 00:01:59.665
Oh my God.

00:02:00.617 --> 00:02:01.450
- Okay, I'm freaking out.

00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.629
- Nice to see you.
- Hi!

00:02:02.629 --> 00:02:04.022
- Hi.
- Can I hug you?

00:02:04.022 --> 00:02:06.539
- Yes, let's hug it out.

00:02:06.539 --> 00:02:07.644
Zigazig ah.

00:02:07.644 --> 00:02:08.644
- Oh my God.

00:02:10.232 --> 00:02:11.349
Pause.

00:02:11.349 --> 00:02:12.182
No.

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:14.653
- Oh my God.

00:02:14.653 --> 00:02:15.788
- I love your stories.

00:02:15.788 --> 00:02:17.703
- Oh my God, I feel like
I'm really gonna cry.

00:02:17.703 --> 00:02:18.961
- I just can't even believe

00:02:18.961 --> 00:02:21.388
that I'm literally sitting here right now.

00:02:21.388 --> 00:02:23.515
- The Spice Girls mean everything to me

00:02:23.515 --> 00:02:25.425
and continue to mean everything to me,

00:02:25.425 --> 00:02:28.043
and I really think that you guys formed

00:02:28.043 --> 00:02:31.220
a whole entire generation of women

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:34.487
who believed in themselves
because you existed.

00:02:34.487 --> 00:02:36.999
- Can I really just say thank you though?

00:02:36.999 --> 00:02:38.866
I don't want to cry, but whatever.

00:02:38.866 --> 00:02:39.881
- Oh my goodness.

00:02:39.881 --> 00:02:42.309
- As a young gay kid,
it was a thing of like,

00:02:42.309 --> 00:02:44.206
"Oh look I'm different," and I would read

00:02:44.206 --> 00:02:45.759
about you guys and what
you guys went through,

00:02:45.759 --> 00:02:47.263
and I was like, "You know what?

00:02:47.263 --> 00:02:48.796
"I'm gonna be gay, and I'm gonna own it."

00:02:48.796 --> 00:02:51.150
And it was like girl power,
and it was like gay power

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.567
and Latino power.

00:02:53.647 --> 00:02:56.310
I'm like, I can't believe
I'm next to you right now.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:02:57.712
Thank you so much.

00:02:57.712 --> 00:02:58.897
- I feel like the Spice Girls

00:02:58.897 --> 00:03:01.564
is why I was running
around at 10 years old

00:03:01.564 --> 00:03:02.754
screaming girl power.

00:03:02.754 --> 00:03:03.587
- What did that feel like,

00:03:03.587 --> 00:03:06.136
to know that you influenced an era?

00:03:06.136 --> 00:03:08.386
- It was an inedible time,

00:03:08.386 --> 00:03:10.995
but it was amazing to watch

00:03:10.995 --> 00:03:13.734
other women support us in the way that,

00:03:13.734 --> 00:03:16.081
and girls as you did.

00:03:16.081 --> 00:03:18.309
It was just so nice to
have that support and fans

00:03:18.309 --> 00:03:20.940
and people that believed
in what we were doing.

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:22.407
And we just felt like we had a message,

00:03:22.407 --> 00:03:25.115
we had great music, just
writing our own songs

00:03:25.115 --> 00:03:26.884
was really important
to us, 'cause we wanted

00:03:26.884 --> 00:03:29.150
for you guys to identify
with whatever we wrote.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:30.910
We feel like we always
want to thank our fans

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.888
for being so supportive of us.

00:03:33.888 --> 00:03:35.636
- Oh my God!

00:03:35.636 --> 00:03:37.600
I have so many questions for you.

00:03:37.600 --> 00:03:40.268
Do you ever buy big platforms anymore?

00:03:40.268 --> 00:03:42.214
I have so many questions--
- Are these platforms?

00:03:42.214 --> 00:03:43.293
- Yeah, those are pretty big.

00:03:43.293 --> 00:03:44.968
They're not quite as big, okay.

00:03:44.968 --> 00:03:46.474
- Not as (mumbles) but I broke my ankle

00:03:46.474 --> 00:03:47.838
quite a few times on those things.

00:03:47.838 --> 00:03:48.671
- Did you really?

00:03:48.671 --> 00:03:49.504
- Yeah, I actually did.

00:03:49.504 --> 00:03:51.140
- Did you guys really put boogers

00:03:51.140 --> 00:03:52.630
underneath manager's desks and stuff?

00:03:52.630 --> 00:03:54.233
- (laughing) Yeah.

00:03:54.233 --> 00:03:55.066
- [Man] Is that real?

00:03:55.066 --> 00:03:55.899
- We did some vile things.

00:03:55.899 --> 00:03:56.732
- I love it.

00:03:56.732 --> 00:03:57.571
- [Woman] Whats your
favorite Spice Girls song?

00:03:57.571 --> 00:03:59.032
- 2 Become 1 is my favorite, I think.

00:03:59.032 --> 00:04:01.143
But I love Say You'll Be There as well.

00:04:01.143 --> 00:04:02.347
- That, yeah, that's the best.

00:04:02.347 --> 00:04:03.699
Oh my God.

00:04:03.699 --> 00:04:05.571
This is crazy.

00:04:05.571 --> 00:04:07.134
- I'm so grateful for this experience.

00:04:07.134 --> 00:04:07.967
You don't even know.

00:04:07.967 --> 00:04:09.051
I'm still shaking.

00:04:09.051 --> 00:04:11.634
- I spoke to Geri this morning.

00:04:13.584 --> 00:04:14.713
And I said that I was doing this,

00:04:14.713 --> 00:04:16.900
and she was like, "Oh my
goodness, so much fun!"

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.297
- We just go to the camera
and do a girl power?

00:04:19.297 --> 00:04:20.627
- Girl power.

00:04:20.627 --> 00:04:21.640
- Girl power.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.601
- Girl power.
- Girl power.

00:04:23.601 --> 00:04:24.563
(laughing)

00:04:24.563 --> 00:04:25.959
- What a damn Monday.

00:04:25.959 --> 00:04:27.248
(laughing)

00:04:27.248 --> 00:04:29.161
- And the biggest fight I
ever got into my dad with was

00:04:29.161 --> 00:04:30.900
whether the Spice Girls or the Beatles

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:33.729
